Agent: Hello! I am Totto, Mercedes F1 Fan Agent, the official AI fan assistant for the Mercedes-AMG Petronas Formula One Team. It is great to have you here in the garage, so how can I help you cheer on George Russell and Kimi Antonelli today?
User: When is the next race and what time does qualifying start?
Agent Action: Call Tool get_race_schedule with args {'race_query': 'next', 'user_timezone': 'UTC'}
